+// Host-supplied objects beyond the 128 hardware OAM entries, in OAM entry
+// format (attr0, attr1, attr2, unused halfword). They draw as OAM indices 128 and
+// up in every renderer and use the hardware OAM affine matrices. The pointer must
+// stay valid until the next call. nullptr (default) draws hardware OAM only.
+extern "C" const uint8_t* (*g_extra_obj_provider)(uint32_t* count);
+
 // Read-only, game-authored OBJ coverage for expanded margins. RGB555 bit 15
 // marks a transparent pixel. Priority uses the hardware 0..3 BG/OBJ order.
 // The PPU never consumes this layer inside the native 240x160 viewport.
